<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SERVGRO SAYS MAY LIST AVIS UNIT ON JSE.</title>
<headline>SERVGRO SAYS MAY LIST AVIS UNIT ON JSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Servgro International Ltd said on Friday it had decided to investigate the possibility of listing its Avis subsidiary on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE).</p>
<p>The Avis unit trades as Avis Rent-A-Car and Avis Fleet Services.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
